msgstr "5e-6 es un buen valor para modelos llama-2."

msgid "8-bit models can offload weights between the CPU and GPU to support fitting very large models into memory. The weights dispatched to the CPU are actually stored in float32, and aren’t converted to 8-bit. "
msgstr "Los modelos de 8 bits pueden descargar pesos entre la CPU y la GPU para poder cargar modelos muy grandes en memoria. Los pesos enviados a la CPU se guardan en float32 y no se convierten a 8 bits. "

