msgid "Backend to use for distributed model workers, either \"ray\" or \"mp\" (multiprocessing). If the product of pipeline_parallel_size and tensor_parallel_size is less than or equal to the number of GPUs available, \"mp\" will be used to keep processing on a single host. Otherwise, this will default to \"ray\" if Ray is installed and fail otherwise. Note that tpu only supports Ray for distributed inference."
msgstr "Backend para los workers distribuidos del modelo: \"ray\" o \"mp\" (multiprocesamiento). Si el producto de pipeline_parallel_size y tensor_parallel_size es menor o igual al número de GPU disponibles, se usa \"mp\" para procesar en un solo host. Si no, se usa \"ray\" si está instalado, y en caso contrario falla. Nota: TPU solo admite Ray para inferencia distribuida."

